<title>USA: AES Corp sells 4.5 mln shrs from shelf.</title>
<headline>AES Corp sells 4.5 mln shrs from shelf.</headline>
<dateline>ARLINGTON, Va. 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>AES Corp said Thursday it sold 4.5 million shares of its common stock from its shelf registration statement for gross proceeds of $358,875,000 million, or $79.75 per share.</p>
<p>Salomon Brothers Inc acted as the underwriter for the offering.</p>
